  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The list gives the mass, in grams, of <math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math> alpine marmots.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<math alttext=\"4,010\"><mn>4,010</mn>\n</math>; <math alttext=\"4,010\"><mn>4,010</mn>\n</math>; <math alttext=\"3,030\"><mn>3,030</mn>\n</math>; <math alttext=\"4,050\"><mn>4,050</mn>\n</math>; <math alttext=\"3,050\"><mn>3,050</mn>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the mean mass, in grams, of these <math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math> alpine marmots?&nbsp;</p>",
